<title>USA: Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $1.05 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $1.05 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $1.05 billion in temporary reserves to the banking system in its overnight system repurchase operation on Tuesday, the Federal Reserve Bank of New York confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
